Type: Package
Package: colliderbias
Title: Adjustment for collider bias in association studies and Mendelian randomisation
Version: 1.1.0
Author: Frank Dudbridge, Siyang Cai
Maintainer: Frank Dudbridge <frank.dudbridge@leicester.ac.uk>
Description: This package uses instrumental variable methods to provide adjustment
    for collider bias in association studies and Mendelian randomisation.
    Adjustment for weak instruments is implemented with Corrected Weighted Least Squares methods.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/DudbridgeLab/colliderbias
BugReports: https://github.com/DudbridgeLab/colliderbias/issues/
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5)
Imports: 
    boot,
    mr.raps
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
